            <div xml:id="d199">

                <pb facs="0362" n="274" sameAs="frus:frus1933v04/pg274"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/2907: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Paraguay</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Wheeler</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Asunción</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-02-28T13:00:00-04:00">February 28, 1933—1
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 1:05 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>28. My telegram 27, February 25, 6 p.m. This Government handed its reply to the
                    ABCP representatives last night. It accepts the proposal <pb facs="0363" n="275"
                        xml:id="pg275"/> on principle with reservations which Ayala considers minor
                    ones.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wheeler</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
